  "text": "Be honest, when was the last time that you read a research paper? The skin industry moves fast. There's new ingredients, new treatments, and new research every week. Staying current shouldn't mean spending hours searching through papers after a full day in clinic, so I built the Clear Evidence. Every week, one carefully selected research paper that is graded for quality and broken down to read in five minutes. It covers ingredient science, treatment protocols, skin conditions, and lifestyle with what, with what it means for you in your practice. So consider it your weekly knowledge upgrade. To join us, the link is in our bio.",
